

{
  "itemIdentifier": "ogc.cwl.v1_2_1.requirements.NetworkAccessRequirement",
  "name": "NetworkAccessRequirement",
  "itemClass": "schema",
  "abstract": "`cwltool` extension hint/requirement indicating whether a\nprocess needs outgoing network access. If not specified or false, tools must not assume network\naccess beyond localhost; if true, the tool may make outgoing connections, though implementations may\nstill apply their own security policies. Does not imply a publicly routable address or inbound\nconnections.",
